This small project tries to apply in practice the concepts provided in Chapter II.

It maps 1:1 to the book:

- preprocessing/features = turning text into the binary variable Wn

- model = user "Specification + Parametric forms" (decomposition + Laplace)

- train = "Identification"

- predict = "Question" as in P(Spam | w)

- evaluate = reproduce Table-style results / sanity checks